---
---
<section id="content" class="bg-white py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto space-y-12">

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-6 rounded-[4px]">
          <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-3">Review Generation & Feedback Capture</h3>
          <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
            Automate requests via email, SMS, web forms, QR codes or NFC to gather more reviews and private feedback.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-6 rounded-[4px]">
          <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-3">Video Testimonial Collection</h3>
          <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
            Request and capture authentic video testimonials directly from customers to share on your website and social media.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-6 rounded-[4px]">
          <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-3">Multi-Site Review Monitoring & Management</h3>
          <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
            Consolidate reviews from Google, Facebook, industry directories, etc., into one dashboard.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-6 rounded-[4px]">
          <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-3">Smart Response & Sentiment Tools</h3>
          <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
            Use AI to generate replies, detect sentiment trends, and flag issues for attention.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-6 rounded-[4px]">
          <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-3">Share & Amplify Reviews</h3>
          <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
            Easily post your best written and video testimonials to your website, social platforms, or marketing materials.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[20px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">Key extras:</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Customizable campaigns & drip messaging</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Over 600+ review site integrations</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Real-time alerts and notifications</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>HIPAA compliance and enterprise security (data encryption, secure passwords)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[36px] leading-[50.4px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">Features & Capabilities - All the Tools You Need to Win Reviews</h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">1. Review Request & Campaigns</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Prebuilt templates or fully custom messages</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Email & SMS campaigns with timed delays</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>QR codes / NFC tags for in-store review linking</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Private feedback forms (before public posting) to let unhappy customers vent privately</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">2. Video Testimonial Requests</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Send video testimonial invitations by text or email</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Simple upload from phone or desktop</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Collect authentic, high-converting customer stories</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Publish video reviews on your website, landing pages, and social channels</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Build trust with face-to-face feedback</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">3. Review Aggregation & Monitoring</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Pull in reviews from Google, Facebook, Yelp, and industry directories</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Real-time alerts of new reviews</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Filtering / tagging / organizing for team workflows (e.g. "needs reply," "positive," "negative")</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">4. Response Tools & AI Assistant</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>AI-assisted reply suggestions</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Response library/templates</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Ability to respond to Google & Facebook reviews from inside the Review Driver dashboard (via API partnership)</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">5. Listings & Local SEO / Presence Management</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Manage and sync business listings across directories</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Ensure consistency in name / address / phone (NAP)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Help you outrank competitors via reputation signals</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">6. Share / Amplify Reviews</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Publish or embed testimonials and video reviews on your website</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Social media sharing tools</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Schedule positive reviews to go live on your social channels or marketing materials</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">7. Check-In & Visitor Management (Optional / add-on tool)</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Contactless visitor check-in via QR codes or tablets</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Collect visitor data, photos, signatures</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Trigger review request after check-in</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>HIPAA compliant check-in (important for healthcare)</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">8. Enterprise & Multi-Location Support</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Scalable platform for large businesses / franchises</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Central dashboard to manage multiple locations</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Granular permissions & role-based access</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Advanced reporting & benchmarking across locations</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">9. Security / Compliance / Support</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>Encryption, secure credentials, and data protection</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>HIPAA compliance for sensitive industries</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>100% U.S. based support (phone, email)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
                <span>No long-term contracts — month-to-month billing</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[36px] leading-[50.4px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">Benefits & ROI - What You Gain</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Boosted visibility & SEO impact:</strong> More high-quality written and video reviews help you rank higher in local search.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Greater trust & credibility:</strong> Potential customers trust authentic stories — especially video testimonials that show real people.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Better customer feedback loop:</strong> Catch issues before they become public, turn unhappy customers into advocates.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Time & resource savings:</strong> Automate repetitive tasks, centralize review management, reduce manual work.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Measurable results:</strong> Track trends, benchmark by location, see which campaigns drive reviews or revenue.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Risk mitigation:</strong> Early alerts to negative feedback, quicker responses, better control over narrative.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[36px] leading-[50.4px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">Get Started in 3 Simple Steps</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-6">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold text-[24px] font-serif flex-shrink-0">1.</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-2">Onboard & Set Up</h3>
              <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
                Account creation, connect your review sites and listings, configure templates and workflows.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold text-[24px] font-serif flex-shrink-0">2.</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-2">Launch Campaigns & Collect Feedback</h3>
              <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
                Automatic or manual review and video testimonial requests, collect private feedback first to mitigate issues, request public reviews and video testimonials from satisfied customers.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold text-[24px] font-serif flex-shrink-0">3.</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-2">Manage & Amplify</h3>
              <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
                Monitor incoming reviews, respond or escalate, share written and video testimonials across channels, support & training included via onboarding, webinars, guides, and dedicated account team.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-8 rounded-[4px]">
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">Ready to Transform Your Online Reputation?</h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Get started with Review Driver today and start generating more authentic reviews, video testimonials, and building trust with your clients.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-[rgb(34,66,125)] text-white rounded-[4px] px-6 py-3 text-[18px] font-normal hover:bg-[rgb(26,51,97)] transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center">
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
